  "answer": "This is a request for Mac-style file tagging in Windows, and it has been reported before. PowerToys#150 ('Improved file tagging system') is the main thread. PowerToys#31990 and PowerToys#23161 were closed as duplicates of it. None of these tickets mentions OpenMeta. The nearest idea in #150 is reading and writing macOS extended attributes. Add your OpenMeta and AI-tagging points to #150 and upvote it. There is no built-in solution yet. For now you can use the Windows Properties > Details > Tags field, or third-party tools such as Files or FileMeta, which #150 mentions."
